commit 639ed015397290b3745d163aafe02ffee4aa3f84 (MIT, Copyright 2026 DeepSeek).
They retain log-only session events and correct memory pressure accounting.
The host itself is an explicitly configured external dependency, not downloaded here.
See third_party/dsh/LICENSE and dsh-baseline.json for source and artifact digests.

